Mission Brief&nbsp;

Isar Aerospace is seeking a Senior Computational Engineering Architect to establish and drive the long-term vision, standards, methodologies, and digital infrastructure underpinning engineering analysis across current and future launch vehicle programs. You will be responsible for transforming simulation, modeling, optimization, and digital engineering capabilities into a scalable and strategic company asset, ensuring consistency, traceability, automation, and engineering excellence across all disciplines. &nbsp;

Working closely with the Chief Engineer, Product Principal Engineers, Systems Engineering, Software Platform Team, Design Teams , and IT functions, you will define the future state of engineering analysis, simulation governance, AI-enabled engineering, and the digital thread across the organization. You will ensure that engineering decisions are supported by robust, repeatable, and validated analytical processes while enabling rapid design iteration, optimization, and technology development. &nbsp;

